n of this webpage for more information. Veterans’ & Disability Preference/Re-employment Rights Campus Security & Crime Statistics Clery Report Position Definitions Notice to all applicants: If you are selected as a finalist, job references and a background check may be conducted. South Dakota Board of Regents 306 E. Capital Ave, Suite 200 Pierre, SD 57501 605-773-3455 Back to top Copyright © Faber To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
