      "title": "Department Assistant (QE9678)",
      "description": "South Dakota Board of Regents Employment Opportunities | Department Assistant (QE9678) Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Department Assistant (QE9678) Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Posting Details Logo Institution The University of South Dakota Working Title Department Assistant (QE9678) Posting Number CSA02796P Department Dean of Medical Student Affairs Physical Location of Position (City) Unspecified Posting Text The Office of Medical Student Affairs is a great place to make a difference! This student-centered department is seeking a highly motivated, detail oriented support person to join its close-knit team. The position will assist with managing the MSA office and providing administrative support to the Senior Academic Dean, Associate and Assistant Deans, the SSOM financial aid office and play a vital role in supporting both students and leadership within the Sanford School of Medicine. The position requires a professional who can Successfully manage competing priorities, Meet strict deadlines, Maintain accurate records while utilizing data management systems and Microsoft Office applications, Strong commitment to confidentiality, Exceptional customer service, Communicate effectively, and work collaboratively with students, faculty, and administrators The USD Sanford School of Medicine has announced the move of the first 18 months of the M.D. program and the Division of Biomedical & Translational Sciences from Vermillion to Sioux Falls. Travel between sites may be required. Must be authorized to work in the U.S. Sponsorship is not available for this position. Posting Date 08/19/2026 Closing Date Open Until Filled Yes First Consideration Date 09/02/2026 Advertised Salary $19.27 to $20.00, depending on qualfiications and experience plus state benefits and retirement Duration of the Term 12 months If Other, describe duration NA Appointment 